\section{Evaluation}\label{sec:evaluation}
\editiostamp{2026-09-05}{}

\claimV{In the synthetic Northbridge pilot, the contaminant-controlled run NB-42 validates coefficient \editionum{northbridge-current-coefficient}, replacing the preliminary coefficient \editionum{northbridge-old-coefficient}.}\editiogrounds{northbridge-run-validates-coefficient-seventeen} \claimV{The required raw-output checksum for NB-42 is \texttt{7f3c}; retaining it is a condition for carrying the coefficient into publication.}\editiogrounds{checksum-gates-northbridge-calibration-publication}

\claimV{Deployment has a maximum batch size of \editionum{northbridge-batch-limit}, and a calibration must not be split across batches.}\editiogrounds{northbridge-deployment-uses-batches-of-four} \claimV{The recorded replication decision adopts the current coefficient in batches of \editionum{northbridge-batch-limit} and keeps solvent echo normalization closed.}\editiogrounds{adopt-coefficient-seventeen-under-the-batch-four-constraint}

\claimV{The rejected solvent echo normalization route reproduced the preliminary coefficient because contaminant carry-over entered the reference channel. Its rejection record permits reconsideration only if the reference chemistry changes.}\editiogrounds{reject-the-solvent-echo-normalization-route} \claimV{The recorded next step is blinded replication.}\editiogrounds{resume-northbridge-at-the-blinded-replication} This section reports the recorded pilot outcome and makes no claim of replication success or statistical significance.

